            "OpenAI 支持先进 AI 的评估框架。",
            "OpenAI 支持先进 AI 的安全实践。",
            "OpenAI 支持先进 AI 的全球合作。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "This initiative contributes to the development of a structured environment for advanced AI, potentially influencing the responsible deployment and interoperability of AI technologies across the industry. Establishing shared standards can foster more consistent development and enhance public trust in AI systems.",
          "zh": "此举有助于为先进 AI 创建结构化环境，可能影响 AI 技术在整个行业的负责任部署和互操作性。建立共享标准可以促进更一致的开发，并增强公众对 AI 系统的信任。"
        },
        "source": "OpenAI News",
        "link": "https://openai.com/index/helping-build-shared-standards-for-advanced-ai"
